# Daily poll for the S3DF nightly, for the user crontab on sdfcron001.
#
# S3DF disables scrontab, and user crontabs on login and compute nodes,
# so the line goes on sdfcron001. Add it without dropping your existing
# entries: `crontab -l > cron.txt`, append the line below to cron.txt,
# then `crontab cron.txt`.
# Cron's PATH is only /usr/bin:/bin. It lacks ~/.local/bin, so uv is
# called by its absolute path. The line also sets PATH: sbatch and sacct
# live in /opt/slurm/slurm-curr/bin on S3DF. The build job inherits this
# PATH (sbatch --export ALL), and apptainer needs mksquashfs in /usr/sbin.
# Replace /path/to/state and /path/to/t1-software.
#
# m h dom mon dow  -- daily poll on sdfcron001
15 6 * * * PATH=/opt/slurm/slurm-curr/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin T1_NIGHTLY_STATE=/path/to/state $HOME/.local/bin/uv run --script /path/to/t1-software/sites/s3df/nightly.py poll >> /path/to/state/cron.log 2>&1
